15 V/m</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> circular, 11.18 V/m</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> elliptical, 15 V/m</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> elliptical, 11.18 V/m</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (d)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/680400a7b5a394da100e021904cfe3fe869aee1f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":20,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Given a vector <img src=\"/media/4a674f4ef0f78e93e8b929344e0fe7cd00d2a418.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> in spherical coordinates as <img src=\"/media/5f9727aef422f87db837a46419b46e7f1d152118.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> The divergence of <img src=\"/media/d6ccd321cecde6e96d35cfc63d4f757974a5e583.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> i.e. <img src=\"/media/44dffbe082d0afbb0ca066d7530599fb073a1ab7.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> is ______</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"2.5","high":"2.5"},"solution":"<p>2.5 (2.40 - 2.60)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/205dec33369c152e6705c36ce4e4b2c6daf89cef.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":21,"type":"MCQ","correct":"D","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>\n The direction of the first minor lobe of 4 element isotropic broadside array separated by <img src=\"/media/2769974f2368d5483a211766d6b4c2b068a0669e.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> 23.2°</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> 34.6°</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 38.9°</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 41.4°</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>\n (d)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/35699415c652f035337e8de3d0ee0b06c50363cc.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":22,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>